REPLICA is built on data from the Alzheimer's Disease Neuroimaging Initiative (ADNI).
ADNI data is released only to approved applicants under a Data Use Agreement (DUA). 
The DUA prohibits redistributing the data in any form, including derived files that contain subject-level records. 
For that reason this repository contains no ADNI data and no derived data files: no raw .rda files, no observations_long.csv, no sequence tensors, no per-patient predictions, and no trained model weights (which were fitted on ADNI records).
